# {{name}}

A [fudic](https://github.com/fudiePlatform/fudic) app: single-file `.fud` components compiled to
Declarative Shadow DOM.

```sh
{{pm}} install
{{pm}} run dev        # dev server
{{pm}} run build      # static + incremental SSG build
{{pm}} run preview    # serve the build
```

## Layout

```
{{layoutsDir}}/{{layout}}.fud   the shell every route shares (@RenderBody / @RenderHead)
{{routesDir}}/index.fud        the `/` route
{{componentsDir}}/             components, wired with <link rel="component">
sw.json               Service Worker policy; delete it and no SW is emitted
```

Add pieces with the CLI — it writes the wiring for you:

```sh
fudic g component app-card --in {{routesDir}}/index.fud
fudic g page blog
fudic g layout admin --sections aside
```
